  "label": "Celebration of Individuality",
  "description": "This meme implicitly references the cultural phenomenon of celebrating individuality — the idea that every person or element has inherent value and deserves recognition. This concept is prevalent in modern Western societies, particularly in movements promoting self-expression, personal empowerment, and anti-discrimination. The visual metaphor of diverse figures around the globe reinforces this idea, suggesting that each 'letter' (representing a person or culture) is awesome in its own right.",
